      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Staff approval → patient notice\nPolls Review_Queue. For rows with route DRAFT_PENDING_APPROVAL, reviewer_decision = APPROVED and an empty patient_notified_at, it emails the patient and stamps patient_notified_at so the notice is never sent twice.\nREJECTED rows are left for staff to handle directly. Email failures are marked APPROVED_EMAIL_FAILED.",
